data: {"id": "70d22048b9f24326-final", "run_id": "70d22048b9f24326", "seq": 1958, "ts_ms": 1789370568520, "status": "success", "answer": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-v13/workload` | Terminating | Pod aiops-case-v13/workload stuck in Terminating state |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s Event | Kubernetes | `Normal Killing Stopping container app` (fact-5f375a1c2607) | 确认 kubelet 发起了终止信号，与 Pod Terminating 状态同步。 |\n| 2 | K8s State | Kubernetes | `phase: Running`, `status: Terminating (lasts <invalid>)` (fact-10ed33f930d8, fact-4fedb353c72a) | 状态不一致：Pod 标记为终止中但 K8s 内部状态仍为 Running，表明容器未退出。 |\n| 3 | Logging | Elasticsearch | `application started` (fact-e73acfc8586a), `SIGTERM received; waiting` (fact-d1c20dafb330) | 应用程序捕获到 SIGTERM 后进入等待状态，未执行退出逻辑，解释了为何不响应 K8s 终止请求。 |\n| 4 | Metric | Prometheus | `kube_pod_container_status_restarts_total: 0` (fact-7304ba6593aa) | 重启数为 0，排除了因 OOMKilled 或 CrashLoop 导致的非正常退出。 |\n\n证据链显示：Pod 收到了 SIGTERM 信号（日志与事件证实），但进程并未退出（K8s 状态与重启数证实），而是进入了等待状态（日志证实），导致 Pod 僵死在 Terminating 阶段。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\nApplication PreStop logic deadlock → Application catches SIGTERM and enters infinite loop waiting for `/state/teardown-requested` file → Container fails to exit within terminationGracePeriodSeconds (3900s) → Pod stuck in Terminating state\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n已确认根因为 **应用程序 PreStop 逻辑死锁 (Application PreStop logic deadlock)**。\n\n应用程序在注册 SIGTERM 处理器后进入无限循环，等待文件 `/state/teardown-requested` 的出现。当 Kubelet 发送终止信号时，进程被该阻塞逻辑困住，无法在规定的 `terminationGracePeriodSeconds` 内退出，导致 Pod 永远卡在 Terminating 状态。\n*   **支持证据**：\n    *   `[3]` 日志记录 `SIGTERM received; waiting` (fact-d1c20dafb330) 直接证明了进程捕获信号后进入等待阻塞。\n    *   `[2]` 异常状态 `status: Terminating` 与 `phase: Running` 共存 (fact-4fedb353c72a, fact-10ed33f930d8) 证实了终止流程的停滞。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 1.3m\n├─ 问题定位: 33.2s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 34.5s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-v13/workload: 34.4s (Evidence 25.4s, RCA 8.9s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 9.3s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-v13/workload**: pod-terminating-stuck\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 76.921, "metrics": {"run_id": "70d22048b9f24326", "mttr": {"value": "1.3m", "seconds": 76.92981123924255, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "48%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-terminating-stuck", "pass": true, "score": 1.0, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.3}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.2}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.7, "weighted_score": 0.14, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "部分因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.15, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "detail": "核心: pod-terminating-stuck"}, {"name": "llm_self_score", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.8, "weighted_score": 0.16, "description": "LLM 自评分数", "detail": "来源: layer_confidence, 分数: 80%"}], "confidence_penalties": [], "evidence_breakdown": {"total": 0, "breakdown": {}}, "performance": {"total_duration_ms": 76929.81123924255, "llm_calls": 12, "llm_duration_ms": 73675.09484291077, "tool_calls": 13, "executed_tool_calls": 11, "deduplicated_tool_calls": 2, "successful_tool_calls": 13, "failed_tool_calls": 0, "tool_duration_ms": 7195.381164550781, "tool_wall_duration_ms": 2942.81530380